 "bundle:ekc-1.1": {
  "id": "5b7ec48d-4da6-4075-b817-87d494dc2c30",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Add canary tokens to the system prompt that fire on exfiltration.": {
  "id": "29f98ba3-a168-4a4e-b1ed-04acd06a5a23",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Apply Meta's \"Agents Rule of Two\": no single agent should process untrusted input, hold secrets or private data, and change state or communicate externally at the same time.": {
  "id": "ff63f76b-9bff-468e-a2ca-e5c5b417ba6f",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Attach provenance (writer identity, source content hash, time) to every memory entry and keep it through summarization.": {
  "id": "ce6dbed4-359e-4091-af0b-46327ed130dc",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Attestation on MCP endpoints.": {
  "id": "8cd10ced-6d5f-4571-a193-69a881433ad6",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Block clipboard-to-terminal and Run-dialog sequences initiated by the agent.": {
  "id": "c7bdc276-d44e-4f7d-a1df-6a2bd07e0db0",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Change control on system prompts and stored skills.": {
  "id": "cc0fd1d2-5f2d-4545-a02c-0d96b13ad858",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Classical DLP, monitoring, segmentation.": {
  "id": "489b079f-af53-46ac-aa00-ff122f009e48",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Conversation-graph analysis to surface recurring instruction sources.": {
  "id": "b6ae8546-d232-490e-b341-d67601ec015e",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Deny file:// and local-network navigation to agents by default.": {
  "id": "f30f9e72-476a-4f4b-bf90-69f112dc59bf",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Entropy analysis on agent-to-agent fields.": {
  "id": "1b5523d9-ae54-49d2-8261-8f21db956e8e",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Follow the MCP authorization rules: servers must not accept tokens not issued to them, and proxies need per-client consent.": {
  "id": "fb614f94-7a3f-4b7d-b387-08c1f86789be",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Ground the session in the user's original intent and end delegations that drift off-task.": {
  "id": "5ef957d8-3219-4bbf-b556-c24b20907905",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Handle every peer response as untrusted input, the same way the framework treats retrieved web content.": {
  "id": "95e6f22d-ff6b-4c1e-940f-20c2650e6080",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Human-in-the-loop on high-impact tools.": {
  "id": "80dac296-88a4-416c-a7d5-a601563d05b9",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Hunt for prefilled-prompt links in mail, chat and proxy logs. Microsoft published starter queries for this in February 2026.": {
  "id": "beaa546d-0d19-48b1-b786-31f25fb962e6",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Identity propagation review: does the downstream system know it is acting on behalf of an agent, not a user?": {
  "id": "042ac46f-dbaa-4536-bc47-19e5d4437c5c",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Indirect-injection detection on every untrusted inbound content stream: web, email, RAG corpus, MCP tool descriptions, multi-modal inputs.": {
  "id": "07e440e7-ccb6-4dc6-81bb-1636f55a5574",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Issue short-lived, narrowly scoped tokens per agent and per task. Bind them to the workload where the IdP supports it.": {
  "id": "0933332b-e0e4-468a-ad75-39a7f4c52baa",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Keep a model bill of materials (M-BOM) for every deployed model, including base model identity, fine-tuning data hashes, and adapter provenance.": {
  "id": "35354957-c25c-4b69-b07a-3e2a85391fdc",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Keep an allowlist of peer agents per workflow. Treat discovery of a new peer as a change that needs review.": {
  "id": "411dfd01-3060-4740-aaae-b0661b69ac1e",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Keep the public Agent Card to what an unauthenticated caller needs. Put additional skills in the extended card, which A2A v1.0 says must require authentication, and keep internal service URLs and credentials out of both cards, as the specification advises.": {
  "id": "1377c1dc-3649-4f0b-b6fc-c54f4432166e",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Memorization probes in red-team suites.": {
  "id": "0351316b-48cf-4fd4-90cc-977a9c5a1016",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Memory write audit trails.": {
  "id": "9b9c4abb-0829-4fb9-b808-246e2b94c10d",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Per-tool blast-radius limits.": {
  "id": "711e4777-6731-45eb-becd-a0a05af66800",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Quarantine and sandbox newly added MCP servers. Review tool descriptions as untrusted input.": {
  "id": "167d2128-769e-4d53-83ff-e2f0c53e1c6c",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Query-pattern analytics.": {
  "id": "aa99993c-a22e-4c38-87c2-ec1dc10ff07e",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Rate-limit and behavior-cluster prompt traffic per user identity.": {
  "id": "0f667cc5-ea1f-4e26-8b8d-39bd38fb6eec",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Rate-limit and log card retrieval like any other discovery endpoint.": {
  "id": "b3e1971e-cf4c-432c-8027-3ad84964c443",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Record agent sessions (screens plus action log) so an investigator can replay what the agent saw.": {
  "id": "3ebed0b6-3fc5-4cc3-97f8-0166db44ee13",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Redact identifying response artifacts.": {
  "id": "f1ccd8d0-29d4-4a6b-8cb8-3f6fef5a61cf",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Require explicit user confirmation before a prompt that arrived through a URL can write to memory.": {
  "id": "11217a39-ab16-46e4-aa2b-2b3844260228",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Require out-of-band human approval for sensitive tools invoked while a delegation is open.": {
  "id": "acf638d7-7292-4a02-a811-f902722ecdae",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Require out-of-band human confirmation for credential retrieval, downloads and command execution.": {
  "id": "50dc0195-085d-4929-b920-3400896e2b84",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Restrict tool enumeration to authenticated, audited callers.": {
  "id": "c5ba61ba-3022-41bc-8e7a-ad4b8b050af5",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Return extended-card content per caller. The specification requires agents to check a client's permissions before returning privileged information.": {
  "id": "d1d1bb49-a2fe-4f35-90b5-51141484f784",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Routine backdoor-trigger scanning against deployed models using published benchmarks.": {
  "id": "49cb93d0-bfa2-4e14-bfaa-3cf438ddd31c",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Run computer-use agents in an isolated VM or container with no access to the user's real profile, files or password manager.": {
  "id": "60c74842-887d-4950-80bc-1c8673b7c182",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Separate per-user memory from shared memory. Require review or a higher trust level to write to the shared store.": {
  "id": "4846b895-1521-44e3-8d5d-07f880f44fee",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Show users what was saved to memory and give them a one-step way to remove it.": {
  "id": "d04fba33-4f1f-464c-a38f-6e7891efbfdc",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Sign and verify model artifacts. Pin specific commit hashes for registry-hosted models.": {
  "id": "e3d9aaaa-642b-453b-86e6-658c8398e38f",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Strip or flag instruction-like text in rendered content before the agent plans its next action.": {
  "id": "cfe73406-732f-4183-a535-41f50f168247",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Support point-in-time rollback of memory, the same way a corpus or database is restored after tampering.": {
  "id": "8dddb26c-37f3-4aac-9b0e-4abc94f53706",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Surface remote-agent turns and resulting tool calls to the user instead of only the final consolidated answer.": {
  "id": "1f2db256-b1a0-4369-abad-391922d3f654",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Tool-call argument lineage tracking. Any tool invocation whose arguments derive from untrusted text is treated as high-risk by default.": {
  "id": "9e0cd8fb-6125-416c-9aa4-e6925797c0f8",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Verify Agent Card signatures (A2A v1.0 defines JWS signatures over a JCS-canonicalized card) and pin keys for known peers.": {
  "id": "d9c17bad-2751-45b4-a4fb-d54f430a51d4",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
 "course-of-action:Watermarking of model outputs.": {
  "id": "71189e3e-9049-495d-b82e-313496bc9df3",
  "created": "2026-11-08"
 },
